            json: "{\"field\":{\"args\":[{\"gqltype\":\"[CartSelectableAddressInput!]!\",\"name\":\"addresses\",\"reqd\":true,\"type\":\"CartSelectableAddressInput\"},{\"gqltype\":\"ID!\",\"name\":\"cartId\",\"reqd\":true,\"type\":\"ID\"}],\"deprecated\":false,\"desc\":\"Replaces all delivery addresses on a [`Cart`](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront/current/objects/Cart) with a new set of addresses in a single operation. Unlike [`cartDeliveryAddressesUpdate`](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront/current/mutations/cartDeliveryAddressesUpdate), which modifies existing addresses, this mutation removes all current addresses and sets the provided list as the new delivery addresses.\\n\\nOne address can be marked as selected, and each address can be flagged for one-time use or configured with a specific validation strategy.\\n\",\"gqltype\":\"CartDeliveryAddressesReplacePayload\",\"list\":false,\"name\":\"cartDeliveryAddressesReplace\",\"reqd\":false,\"type\":\"CartDeliveryAddressesReplacePayload\"},\"invocation\":{\"doc\":\"mutation CartUpdateDeliveryAddressesReplace($addresses: [CartSelectableAddressInput!]!, $cartId: ID!) { cartDeliveryAddressesReplace(addresses: $addresses, cartId: $cartId) { cart { ...CartFields } } } fragment CartFields on Cart { checkoutUrl createdAt id note totalQuantity updatedAt }\",\"field\":\"cartDeliveryAddressesReplace\",\"optype\":\"mutation\",\"vars\":[{\"from\":\"\",\"gqltype\":\"[CartSelectableAddressInput!]!\",\"name\":\"addresses\"},{\"from\":\"cartId\",\"gqltype\":\"ID!\",\"name\":\"cartId\"}]},\"protocol\":\"graphql\",\"types\":{\"Boolean\":{\"desc\":\"The `Boolean` scalar type represents `true` or `false`.\",\"fields\":{},\"kind\":\"SCALAR\",\"name\":\"Boolean\"},\"CartAddressInput\":{\"desc\":\"Specifies a delivery address for a cart. Provide either a [`deliveryAddress`](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront/current/input-objects/CartAddressInput#fields-deliveryAddress) with full address details, or a [`copyFromCustomerA